{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"6225","name":"塔德菈","desc":"塔德菈","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/03/76297419/682ef07d53e306226d231b8f8256c1c3_2352187106537716014.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"塔德菈","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"性别\",\"value\":[\"女\"]},{\"key\":\"位置\",\"value\":[\"塔尼特露营地\"]},{\"key\":\"功能\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]},{\"key\":\"相关任务\",\"value\":[\"「比勒琪丝的哀歌」\"]},{\"key\":\"职业\",\"value\":[\"暂无\"]}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"key\":\"心声\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e···下一场「狩猎」，嗯···\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"编者注：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e她只是个刚成年的女孩子啊！\u003c/p\u003e\"]}],\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/03/76297419/25ec7757f1201ec8999b7ce9ed6ae87a_4757075617149932915.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"1207","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"NPC立绘\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/03/76297419/23e925e41925e28856c895b3dd2c4282_4971253167504689241.png\"},{\"tab_name\":\"NPC位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/03/76297419/9984e79b26fe44fe945781e5f2cbe193_1108168732956653781.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1208","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"商品列表","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【开场白】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e（她局促地别开目光。然后紧张地低下了头。）\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【你还好吗？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e抱歉，狩猎已经结束了。我是父亲的「猎鹰」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e不过我很好，请您不要担心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【这么极端吗···？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e极端···？我不知道，我从懂事起就是这样活着的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e啊···不过···你和派蒙的故事，你们的旅行···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e有机会的话，我想多听你讲讲。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e好呀，我们有好多好多故事呢！\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【嗯，我会的。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【你想听的话，我随时可以给你讲。】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e噗···\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e咳咳，没什么，我只是很高兴···谢谢你···呃，您。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【关于你和马塞拉的关系···】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e我说过，他是我的父亲，我是他的「猎鹰」。我跟随他的指令，为他而猎，为他而死···因为他代表了塔尼特的意志。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e假如我什么时候无法贯彻父亲的指令了，那么作为「猎鹰」的生命就这样结束了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【你没想过为自己而活吗？】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e······\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e···不，没有。没想过，没期待过。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e沙漠很冷酷，没有闲暇考虑自己。没有我，还有很多人能活，但没有部族···我没办法一个人活下去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id"